{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/95567-what-kinds-of-stories-do-you-tell-with-scion","id":95567,"title":"What kinds of stories do you tell with Scion?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-21T06:40:54-07:00","id":95567,"title":"What kinds of stories do you tell with Scion?","content":"Pretty simple. What kinds of storied do you/can you tell in the setting?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/961-chewygranola","name":"ChewyGranola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T08:09:08-07:00","id":95646,"title":"","content":"You can tell any story you wish to with Scion (or TOON, for that matter).<br /> As for what stories do I tell: My longest running game focuses on the divine politics regarding the players' fit into the cosmology. While they were seen as useful tools in Hero and early Demigod, no God wants to relinquish even a fraction of their power to welcome an upstart into the ranks. Earlier stories tend to parallel their divine parents' own legends (Fate, history repeats, etc)as a way to highlight the heroes' differences.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1011-phgraves","name":"PHGraves","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1011_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T12:18:47-07:00","id":95833,"title":"","content":"I tend to tell broad arcs. A